value. So let's dig into the connection then between suffering and pleasure just a little bit more. It touches on several things that I mentioned in the intro like watching horror movies, listening to sad songs on a more extreme. And you've talked about BDSM. I just want to tell some of our vanilla listeners that that refers to bondage, dominance, submission, sadomasochism, sexual practices. which you talk about at length in the book, you delve into several possible explanations for why so many of us seem to actually enjoy doing the things that bring us either physical or emotional pain.

